  "title": "Federal Operation Targets Trucking Safety Risks, Removes Hundreds of Drivers From US Roads",
  "summary": "Operation Highway Shield Focuses on Commercial Driver Safety and Enforcement Federal and state authorities have launched a major roadside enforcement campaign aimed at improving safety across America’s highways. The operation, known as Operation Highway Shield, resulted in hundreds of commercial drivers and vehicles being removed from service after officials identified safety violations, licensing concerns, and other compliance issues. The enforcement effort took place from July 28 to July 30",
